  "content": "![Muse NRP blog thumbnail](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=878166652047061&version=1789771377&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nIntroducing Muse\n\n# AI that gets it done\n\n[![Get it on Google Play](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=798468513292079&version=1790101056&transcode_extension=webp)](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.facebook.aura&referrer=utm_source%3Dai_meta_site%26utm_medium%3Dweb%26utm_campaign%3Dmuse_header_google-play_09232026)[![Download on the App Store](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1675935116850770&version=1790101056&transcode_extension=webp)](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/muse-from-meta/id6760173601?pt=10684&ct=muse_header_app-store_09232026&utm_campaign=muse_header_app-store_09232026)\n\n## What Hatch can do for you while you get on with life\n\nMUSE FEATURES\n\n## Take the busywork off your plate\n\nMuse gets to know you and your goals, working across all aspects of life so you can focus on the things that matter. It comes with strong privacy and security built in, keeping you in control.\n\n[\n\nTry Muse\n\n\n](https://applink.muse.ai/?pt=10684&pid=ai_meta_site&utm_source=ai_meta_site&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=muse_features_try-muse_09232026&utm_content=muse_features_try-muse_09232026&ct=muse_features_try-muse_09232026&referrer=utm_source%3Dai_meta_site%26utm_medium%3Dweb%26utm_campaign%3Dmuse_features_try-muse_09232026%26utm_content%3Dmuse_features_try-muse_09232026)\n\n![Chatting with Muse via mobile or Mac](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=2465669417262632&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nDesigned to feel like a conversation\n\n![Chatting with Muse via mobile or Mac](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=2465669417262632&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nChat with your Muse in the same way you message with other people, using the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp. It’s simple, just tell Muse what you want to get done.\n\nChat with your Muse in the same way you message with other people, using the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp. It’s simple, just tell Muse what you want to get done.\n\nDesigned to feel like a conversation\n\n![Chatting with Muse via mobile or Mac](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=2465669417262632&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nChat with your Muse in the same way you message with other people, using the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp. It’s simple, just tell Muse what you want to get done.\n\nChat with your Muse in the same way you message with other people, using the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp. It’s simple, just tell Muse what you want to get done.\n\n![Muse finding movie tickets for you](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=4646017655684999&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nA secure computer with a browser shared by you and your agent\n\n![Muse finding movie tickets for you](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=4646017655684999&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nMuse Secure VM is a persistent, isolated Linux computer with a full browser that you and your agent can use to complete tasks, allowing you to intervene at any point. It's your computer and your browser, with the storage, CPU, and memory to handle real work.\n\nMuse Secure VM is a persistent, isolated Linux computer with a full browser that you and your agent can use to complete tasks, allowing you to intervene at any point. It's your computer and your browser, with the storage, CPU, and memory to handle real work.\n\nA secure computer with a browser shared by you and your agent\n\n![Muse finding movie tickets for you](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=4646017655684999&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nMuse Secure VM is a persistent, isolated Linux computer with a full browser that you and your agent can use to complete tasks, allowing you to intervene at any point. It's your computer and your browser, with the storage, CPU, and memory to handle real work.\n\nMuse Secure VM is a persistent, isolated Linux computer with a full browser that you and your agent can use to complete tasks, allowing you to intervene at any point. It's your computer and your browser, with the storage, CPU, and memory to handle real work.\n\n![Muse can help set goals and keep track of ideas](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1344529021090015&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nAlways working on your goals and suggesting ideas\n\n![Muse can help set goals and keep track of ideas](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1344529021090015&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nGive Muse a goal or a task and it builds an action plan, tracks your progress and proactively takes tasks off your plate along the way. It learns and gets sharper, coming back with ideas and suggestions built around what you need, ready to act on them under your direction.\n\nGive Muse a goal or a task and it builds an action plan, tracks your progress and proactively takes tasks off your plate along the way. It learns and gets sharper, coming back with ideas and suggestions built around what you need, ready to act on them under your direction.\n\nAlways working on your goals and suggesting ideas\n\n![Muse can help set goals and keep track of ideas](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1344529021090015&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nGive Muse a goal or a task and it builds an action plan, tracks your progress and proactively takes tasks off your plate along the way. It learns and gets sharper, coming back with ideas and suggestions built around what you need, ready to act on them under your direction.\n\nGive Muse a goal or a task and it builds an action plan, tracks your progress and proactively takes tasks off your plate along the way. It learns and gets sharper, coming back with ideas and suggestions built around what you need, ready to act on them under your direction.\n\n![Grid of apps that can connect with Muse](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1116625454127090&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nWorks with your apps and builds its own tools\n\n![Grid of apps that can connect with Muse](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1116625454127090&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nConnect your email, calendar, Instagram and more apps you use daily. If a task needs a tool that doesn't exist, Muse builds it for you.\n\nConnect your email, calendar, Instagram and more apps you use daily. If a task needs a tool that doesn't exist, Muse builds it for you.\n\nWorks with your apps and builds its own tools\n\n![Grid of apps that can connect with Muse](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1116625454127090&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nConnect your email, calendar, Instagram and more apps you use daily. If a task needs a tool that doesn't exist, Muse builds it for you.\n\nConnect your email, calendar, Instagram and more apps you use daily. If a task needs a tool that doesn't exist, Muse builds it for you.\n\nDesigned to feel like a conversation\n\n![Chatting with Muse via mobile or Mac](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=2465669417262632&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nChat with your Muse in the same way you message with other people, using the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp. It’s simple, just tell Muse what you want to get done.\n\nChat with your Muse in the same way you message with other people, using the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp. It’s simple, just tell Muse what you want to get done.\n\nDesigned to feel like a conversation\n\n![Chatting with Muse via mobile or Mac](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=2465669417262632&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nChat with your Muse in the same way you message with other people, using the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp. It’s simple, just tell Muse what you want to get done.\n\nChat with your Muse in the same way you message with other people, using the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp. It’s simple, just tell Muse what you want to get done.\n\nA secure computer with a browser shared by you and your agent\n\n![Muse finding movie tickets for you](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=4646017655684999&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nMuse Secure VM is a persistent, isolated Linux computer with a full browser that you and your agent can use to complete tasks, allowing you to intervene at any point. It's your computer and your browser, with the storage, CPU, and memory to handle real work.\n\nMuse Secure VM is a persistent, isolated Linux computer with a full browser that you and your agent can use to complete tasks, allowing you to intervene at any point. It's your computer and your browser, with the storage, CPU, and memory to handle real work.\n\nA secure computer with a browser shared by you and your agent\n\n![Muse finding movie tickets for you](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=4646017655684999&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nMuse Secure VM is a persistent, isolated Linux computer with a full browser that you and your agent can use to complete tasks, allowing you to intervene at any point. It's your computer and your browser, with the storage, CPU, and memory to handle real work.\n\nMuse Secure VM is a persistent, isolated Linux computer with a full browser that you and your agent can use to complete tasks, allowing you to intervene at any point. It's your computer and your browser, with the storage, CPU, and memory to handle real work.\n\nAlways working on your goals and suggesting ideas\n\n![Muse can help set goals and keep track of ideas](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1344529021090015&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nGive Muse a goal or a task and it builds an action plan, tracks your progress and proactively takes tasks off your plate along the way. It learns and gets sharper, coming back with ideas and suggestions built around what you need, ready to act on them under your direction.\n\nGive Muse a goal or a task and it builds an action plan, tracks your progress and proactively takes tasks off your plate along the way. It learns and gets sharper, coming back with ideas and suggestions built around what you need, ready to act on them under your direction.\n\nAlways working on your goals and suggesting ideas\n\n![Muse can help set goals and keep track of ideas](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1344529021090015&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nGive Muse a goal or a task and it builds an action plan, tracks your progress and proactively takes tasks off your plate along the way. It learns and gets sharper, coming back with ideas and suggestions built around what you need, ready to act on them under your direction.\n\nGive Muse a goal or a task and it builds an action plan, tracks your progress and proactively takes tasks off your plate along the way. It learns and gets sharper, coming back with ideas and suggestions built around what you need, ready to act on them under your direction.\n\nWorks with your apps and builds its own tools\n\n![Grid of apps that can connect with Muse](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1116625454127090&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nConnect your email, calendar, Instagram and more apps you use daily. If a task needs a tool that doesn't exist, Muse builds it for you.\n\nConnect your email, calendar, Instagram and more apps you use daily. If a task needs a tool that doesn't exist, Muse builds it for you.\n\nWorks with your apps and builds its own tools\n\n![Grid of apps that can connect with Muse](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1116625454127090&version=1790122886&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nConnect your email, calendar, Instagram and more apps you use daily. If a task needs a tool that doesn't exist, Muse builds it for you.\n\nConnect your email, calendar, Instagram and more apps you use daily. If a task needs a tool that doesn't exist, Muse builds it for you.\n\n![Chatting with Muse via mobile or Mac](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=2465669417262632&version=1790192623&transcode_extension=webp)\n\nSECURE AND IN CONTROL\n\n![](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1412395267704444&version=1790122473&transcode_extension=webp)\n\n### Your personal data is safe and secure\n\nYour logins are kept in a secure credential store your agent can't read, with **1Password** integration coming soon. When shopping, a one-time card number is generated at checkout so your real card is never seen by the merchant or your agent. Eligible purchases are covered by [Link’s purchase protections](https://link.com/protections), a first for AI agents, and your conversations are not shared with Meta's ad systems.\n\n![](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1895977861394271&version=1790122473&transcode_extension=webp)\n\n### Approve critical actions from your agent\n\nReview and approve actions from Muse before they happen, like sending emails and making purchases. See a complete audit trail of everything your agent has done (and what it is planning to do).\n\n## MUSE IN ACTION\n\n### See how Muse works for you\n\nFrom email and calendar management to saving money, improving your health, and shopping smarter. Muse handles it all.\n\n[\n\nTry Muse\n\n\n](https://applink.muse.ai/?pt=10684&pid=ai_meta_site&utm_source=ai_meta_site&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=muse_in-action_try-muse_09232026&utm_content=muse_in-action_try-muse_09232026&ct=muse_in-action_try-muse_09232026&referrer=utm_source%3Dai_meta_site%26utm_medium%3Dweb%26utm_campaign%3Dmuse_in-action_try-muse_09232026%26utm_content%3Dmuse_in-action_try-muse_09232026)\n\n## CREATOR STORIES\n\n### Get inspired\n\nMuse is helping people manage and achieve their goals and everyday tasks.\n\n[\n\nTry Muse\n\n\n](https://applink.muse.ai/?pt=10684&pid=ai_meta_site&utm_source=ai_meta_site&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=muse_creator-stories_try-muse_09232026&utm_content=muse_creator-stories_try-muse_09232026&ct=muse_creator-stories_try-muse_09232026&referrer=utm_source%3Dai_meta_site%26utm_medium%3Dweb%26utm_campaign%3Dmuse_creator-stories_try-muse_09232026%26utm_content%3Dmuse_creator-stories_try-muse_09232026)\n\n**Ryan Serhant** talks through how his Muse, Pumpkin, gets tasks done\n\n**Ashley Graham’s** Muse, Lux, helps her organize her whole life\n\n**Teyana Taylor** problem solves with her Muse, AunTEY\n\n**Ally Love’s** Muse, Mango, helps her stay on top of business\n\n## MUSE FOR SMALL BUSINESS\n\n### AI that works for your small business\n\nMuse is now expanding with Muse for Small Business—a collection of new skills and connectors for the small business owner whose to-do list has a to-do list.\n\n[\n\nTry Muse\n\n\n](https://muse.ai/business?utm_source=ai_meta_site&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=muse_for-small-business_try-muse_09282026&utm_content=muse_for-small-business_try-muse_09292026)\n\n![Muse desktop Mac app](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1404459274486584&version=1790125805&transcode_extension=webp)\n\n### Download Muse for Mac\n\nMuse works with your desktop computer files, apps and browser tabs.\n\n[\n\nDownload for macOS\n\n\n](https://scontent-atl3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.110568-6/825274034_1639332381192128_4653688136291480731_n.dmg/Muse-4.1.dmg?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=116824&_nc_ohc=TC93nUi2IYkQ7kNvwElSmLI&_nc_oc=AdqI0BV6gtGgiZpafGMCFu2Bzz8ldQuhePC0Ob5XWGL2qVRewv2L1_yFv3yoYbOeGYY&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.xx&_nc_gid=HQOywxdNehImWeZq7-GqWQ&_nc_ss=79289&oh=00_AQMbdcREnYXbdO6qapHc47dycCdQreOF8tYS47dWXN5SKw&oe=6AC1CD7D)[\n\nLearn more\n\n\n](/muse/download/)\n\n![Try Muse background](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=4037036369935159&version=1788802033&transcode_extension=webp)\n\n![](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1695517941517570&version=1788554990&transcode_extension=webp)\n\n## TRY MUSE\n\n### Ready to get more done with Muse?\n\n[![Get it on Google Play](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=798468513292079&version=1790101056&transcode_extension=webp)](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.facebook.aura&referrer=utm_source%3Dai_meta_site%26utm_medium%3Dweb%26utm_campaign%3Dtry_muse_mobile_google-play_09232026)[![Download on the App Store](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1675935116850770&version=1790101056&transcode_extension=webp)](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/muse-from-meta/id6760173601?pt=10684&ct=try_muse_mobile_app-store_09232026&utm_campaign=try_muse_mobile_app-store_09232026)\n\n[\n\nGet started\n\n\n](https://applink.muse.ai/?pt=10684&pid=ai_meta_site&utm_source=ai_meta_site&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=muse_more-done_started_09232026&utm_content=muse_more-done_started_09232026&ct=muse_more-done_started_09232026&referrer=utm_source%3Dai_meta_site%26utm_medium%3Dweb%26utm_campaign%3Dmuse_more-done_started_09232026%26utm_content%3Dmuse_more-done_started_09232026)\n\n## FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS\n\n### What can Muse do?\n\nMuse can answer questions, complete tasks, [browse the web](https://www.meta.com/help/2124746764949121/), make purchases, generate images, create documents, and connect with your favorite [apps and services](https://www.meta.com/help/1687253048996149/) via [Connectors](http://www.meta.com/help/1687253048996149). It can also set reminders, track goals, and monitor things you care about, all working in the background on your behalf. Learn [how we designed Muse](https://introducing.muse.ai/).\n\n### How does Muse work?\n\nBecause it’s [agentic AI](/learn/agentic-ai/what-is-agentic-ai/), when you give Muse a task, it figures out which [built-in skills](https://www.meta.com/help/2797651547267109/) it needs and gets to work. It can browse the web, pull information from connected apps, and take action across multiple steps. You stay in control by setting permissions, reviewing and approving what it does along the way.\n\n### Is Muse free?\n\nMuse is available for free with a usage limit. If you reach your free limit and want more, you can upgrade to a paid subscription, or wait until your free usage limit refreshes.\n\n### Is Muse safe?\n\nYes. Muse is built with automated protections, agentic AI security standards, and [user controls](https://www.meta.com/help/1047255454427887) designed to prevent harmful content and unauthorized actions. It also uses a protective layer to stop your information from being shared without your approval. You can [review your agent's activity](https://www.meta.com/help/1385290430137537), manage permissions, and report issues at any time.\n\n### Does Muse keep working after I close the app?\n\nYes. When you ask Muse to do something, it keeps working in the background whether you're actively using the app or not. For example, if you ask it to monitor daily weather reports and alert you about rain, it will do that on its own without you needing to check in.\n\n### Does Muse ask before it acts on my behalf?\n\nYes. Muse is designed to ask your permission before taking certain actions, like sending messages, making purchases, or sharing information with a connected app. You can choose to allow an action once, always allow it, or deny it. You can manage your [default permission settings](https://www.meta.com/help/1385290430137537/) for every connection at any time.\n\n### What is a personal AI agent?\n\nA personal [AI agent](/learn/agentic-ai/what-are-ai-agents/) is an AI that can take actions and get things done on your behalf, not just answer questions. Muse, for example, can browse the web, connect to your apps, complete multi-step tasks, and keep working in the background with your direction and oversight.\n\n### How is a personal agent different from a chatbot or AI assistant?\n\nA chatbot responds to one question at a time. An AI assistant can handle more complex conversations and generate content. A personal AI agent like Muse goes further: it can take real actions across the web and connected apps, work through multi-step tasks on its own, and keep running in the background even after you close the app.\n\n### What can a personal AI agent help with?\n\nA personal AI agent can help with everyday tasks like booking reservations, monitoring prices, managing reminders, creating documents, generating images, and researching topics. It can also connect to third-party apps and services to take actions on your behalf, like sending emails or completing online purchases. See more [agentic AI examples](/learn/agentic-ai/agentic-ai-examples/).\n\n## Explore Meta AI products\n\n![Meta AI personal assistant on mobile device](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=1439398780789643&version=1780357570&transcode_extension=webp)\n\n### Meta AI Assistant\n\n#### Get more done with Meta AI, your personal AI assistant.\n\n[\n\nTry Meta AI\n\n\n](http://applink.meta.ai/?pt=10684&pid=ai_meta_site&utm_source=ai_meta_site&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=lh-hub-page_get-more-done_try-on-meta-ai_05072026&utm_content=lh-hub-page_get-more-done_try-on-meta-ai_05072026&ct=lh-hub-page_get-more-done_try-on-meta-ai_05072026&referrer=utm_source%3Dai_meta_site%26utm_medium%3Dweb%26utm_campaign%3Dlh-hub-page_get-more-done_try-on-meta-ai_05072026%26utm_content%3Dlh-hub-page_get-more-done_try-on-meta-ai_05072026)\n\n[\n\nLearn more\n\n\n](/meta-ai/assistant/)\n\n![Meta AI media generation output cards](https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/elementpath/media/?media_id=2581178958999069&version=1784931174&transcode_extension=webp)\n\n### Image Generation\n\n#### Explore fun presets, make precise edits and visualize your ideas.\n\n[\n\nStart generating\n\n\n](https://applink.meta.ai/?pt=10684&pid=ai_meta_site&utm_source=ai_meta_site&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=learning_hub_start-generating_07242026&utm_content=learning_hub_start-generating_07242026&ct=learning_hub_start-generating_07242026&referrer=utm_source%3Dai_meta_site%26utm_medium%3Dweb%26utm_campaign%3Dlearning_hub_start-generating_07242026%26utm_content%3Dlearning_hub_start-generating_07242026)\n\n[\n\nLearn more\n\n\n](/meta-ai/media-generation/)"
